<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">I'll take a pair in size 38.</font></font></i>

221
00:16:53,520 --> 00:16:55,320
<i><font size="16"><font face="Arial">Here's the deposit.</font></font></i>

222
00:16:56,040 --> 00:16:57,640
HERE'S THE DEPOSIT

223
00:16:58,840 --> 00:17:00,160
Eighteen hundred!

224
00:17:12,520 --> 00:17:15,119
HOM THONG
BOONYOD FARM

225
00:17:36,080 --> 00:17:37,120
Hello, Maysa.

226
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:40,160
I just sent you 10,000 for the merch.

227
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:17,080
What's wrong, Ob?

228
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:23,800
Last guys finish last, man.

229
00:18:30,760 --> 00:18:32,920
I don't know about chicken,

230
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:36,680
but there's plenty of fish in the sea.
Right, Hom Ngern?

231
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:43,880
Hom Ngern, aren't you tired
of your cray-cray caretaker?

232
00:18:47,760 --> 00:18:49,360
Hold on, hold on.

233
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:52,720
Cray-cray?

234
00:18:53,280 --> 00:18:54,760
I'm trying to make you feel better.

235
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:59,360
If it gets too much for you,
just let Hom Ngern and me know.

236
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:02,360
I'll be fine.

237
00:19:03,400 --> 00:19:05,760
Aren't you sad that you and Rut broke up?

238
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:10,520
I am. And what a waste of time too.

239
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:14,720
After all these years,
I never thought he'd be like this.

240
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:18,520
You can cry if you want to.

241
00:19:19,680 --> 00:19:24,320
Hom Ngern's strong shoulders
are ready for you to cry on.

242
00:19:24,400 --> 00:19:25,720
Right, Hom Ngern?

243
00:19:32,040 --> 00:19:34,840
Why should I cry for a man
who doesn't love me?

244
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:40,920
I'd rather focus on buying Hom Thong back
for my loved ones.

245
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:42,040
Yeah?

246
00:19:47,080 --> 00:19:48,160
Want some bananas?

247
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:52,480
Some bananas?

248
00:19:52,560 --> 00:19:54,800
UNCLE KHWANCHAI
